      "id": "l3-family",
      "title": "Family",
      "objective": "Name family members and talk about brothers and sisters.",
      "tips": [
        "Urdu has separate words for relatives on your mother's and father's side: dada/dadi (father's parents), nana/nani (mother's parents).",
        "\"Mere do bhai hain\" literally means \"my two brothers are\" — that's how Urdu says \"I have two brothers\"."
      ],
