      "tips": [
        "Hosts often insist you eat more. \"Bas, shukriya\" (that's enough, thanks) is the polite way to stop — you may need to say it twice!",
        "\"Mujhe bhook lagi hai\" literally means \"hunger has attached to me\"."
      ],
